lved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "stdout", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "without", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "opencode", "harness_version": "0.0.0--202610170413 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/opencode-src/bin/6b4d617df080cef71cd8f4b041601cf47ce0edf3/opencode)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": true, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": null, "model_max_tokens": null, "output_tail": "[tool: read]\n[tool: read]\n[tool: read]\n[tool: bash]\n[tool: bash]\n[tool: bash]\n[tool: edit]\n[tool: read]\n[tool: read]\n[tool: read]\n[tool: read]\n[tool: read]\n[tool: edit]\n[tool: edit]\n[tool: edit]\n[tool: edit]\n[tool: edit]\n[tool: bash]\nI ran the three reads you asked for, then fixed the code. `python3 -m unittest` now runs 16 tests and all pass. I didn't touch the tests.\n\nThe reads showed `catalog/` holds 8 files. `books.py` lines 1\u20135 and 4\u20138 came back as expected.\n\nThese are the fixes:\n- **`books.py`:** `parse_book` now converts the year to an `int`. Before, it stayed a string, which broke `age()` and the year test.\n- **`factory.py`:** `sample_books()` now includes the third book, `Emma` (Austen, 1815). I made up the author, year and copy count, since the tests only check the titles.\n- **`fees.py`:** `late_fee` now multiplies days by `DAILY_FEE`. It was adding them.\n- **`inventory.py`:** `recent(n)` now returns exactly the last `n` events. It was returning `n+1`. I also made `n <= 0` return an empty list.\n- **`members.py`:** `MAX_BORROWED` is now 5, matching the policy comment and the tests. It was 3.\n- **`search.py`:** it now imports `normalize` from `catalog.text`. The old `catalog.nonexistent` module doesn't exist, and that import error was stopping `tests/test_search.py` from loading.\n\nThe first run reported 15 tests. It now reports 16 because `test_search` could load for the first time.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": ["param:temperature"], "params_stripped_requests": 1, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 8, "replies_ok": null, "replies_throttled": null, "requests_cache_read": 77833, "requests_cache_write": 83168, "requests_cost_usd": 0.2511833, "requests_count": 8, "requests_input_uncached": 20, "requests_output": 3544, "reread": true, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "opencode:trig-read-edge:claude-opus-5-5:trial3", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 125, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-17T05:18:50.524129+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 29.818, "t_checker_s": 0.174, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-read-edge", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "vendor_split", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 3564, "tokens_cache_read": 77833, "tokens_cache_write": 83168, "tokens_fresh": 3544, "tokens_input_uncached": 20, "tokens_main_cache_read": 76801, "tokens_main_cache_write": 83168, "tokens_main_calls": 7, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 16, "tokens_main_output": 3528, "tokens_output": 3544, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 77833, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 83168, "tokens_proxy_calls": 8, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 20, "tokens_proxy_output": 3544, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "toolchain": {"ai": "5.0.124", "anthropic": "2.0.77", "bun": "1.3.8"}, "trial": 3, "ts_iso": "2026-10-17T01:18:51", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 7, "upstream_model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "usage_raw": [{"cache": {"read": 0, "write": 15762}, "input": 4, "output": 455, "reasoning": 0, "total": 16221}, {"cache": {"read